timestamp=2026-11-04T19:18:58.158Z level=INFO run=b8e4cffa message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python << 'PY'\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# Let’s look at ST005 vs district median\nstations = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/stations.csv')\nreadings = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/readings.csv')\nreadings['timestamp'] = pd.to_datetime(readings['timestamp'])\npm10 = readings[readings['pollutant']=='PM10'].pivot(index='timestamp', columns='station_id', values='current_reading')\nst2dist = dict(zip(stations['station_id'], stations['district']))\n\nst = 'ST005'\ndist = st2dist[st]\ndist_sts = [s for s in stations[stations['district']==dist]['station_id'].tolist() if s in pm10.columns and s != st]\ndmed = pm10[dist_sts].median(axis=1)\ndf = pd.concat([pm10[st].rename('st'), dmed.rename('dmed')], axis=1)\nprint(df.to_string())\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
